flowchart TD
  User[Player input] --> Mode[One scene-owned input and view mode owner]
  Mode --> Rear[Same rear manager state and CharacterBody3D]
  Rear --> Third[Third-person pivot / SpringArm3D / Camera3D]
  Rear --> First[First-person eye / Camera3D]
  Mode --> RTS[Independent pan / zoom / inspection RTS camera]
  Mode --> UI[Existing management / modal / placement UI]
  UI --> Commands[Validated commands to existing authoritative owners]
  Rear --> Pose[One authoritative player / entity pose]
  Commands --> Session[One live session and existing game services]
  Session --> Ledger[Identity / holders / actual goods / claims / workers]
  Session --> Jobs[Construction / production / training / transport / HQ issue]
  Session --> Army[Autonomous army / combat / terrain / orders]
  Pose --> Space[Explicit ground / height / local / world conversion boundaries]
  Ledger --> Space
  Army --> Space
  Space --> Models[3D presenters by actual entity ID]
  Jobs --> Events[Committed events and finite work / motion snapshots]
  Events --> Models
  Events --> UI
  Models --> World[Real 3D ground / buildings / people / vehicles / cargo]
  First --> World
  Third --> World
  RTS --> World
  World --> Picking[Physics-safe picking / collision / overlap observations]
  Picking --> Commands
  Hidden[Camera elsewhere] --> Continue[Applicable simulation keeps progressing]
  Continue --> Session
  Note[Presentation never creates goods, workers, jobs or elapsed time] -.-> Models

